#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Executor primitive is part of the [directed execution "
"model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which provides more flexibility "
"when customizing an error mitigation workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitif Executor adalah sebahagian daripada [model pelaksanaan "
"berarah](/guides/directed-execution-model), yang memberikan lebih "
"fleksibiliti apabila menyesuaikan aliran kerja pengurangan ralat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The inputs and outputs of the Executor primitive are very different from "
"those of the [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output) and "
"[Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output) primitives. For example, instead"
" of taking a list of PUBs as the input, Executor takes a `QuantumProgram`, "
"which contains a list of `QuantumProgramItem` objects. These container "
"classes give you more flexibility than a PUB, which is a simple tuple data "
"structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"Input dan output primitif Executor sangat berbeza daripada primitif "
"[Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output) dan [Estimator](/guides/estimator-"
"input-output). Sebagai contoh, daripada mengambil senarai PUB sebagai input,"
" Executor mengambil `QuantumProgram`, yang mengandungi senarai objek "
"`QuantumProgramItem`. Kelas bekas ini memberi anda lebih fleksibiliti "
"berbanding PUB, yang merupakan struktur data tupel mudah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Executor's output is a `QuantumProgramResult`, which is an iterable and "
"contains one element for each input `QuantumProgramItem`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Output Executor adalah `QuantumProgramResult`, yang merupakan iterable dan "
"mengandungi satu elemen untuk setiap `QuantumProgramItem` input.\n"

